1
00:01:18,750 --> 00:01:24,750
Scared Shrekless is a animation, comedy, family film directed by Gary Trousdale.

2
00:02:37,500 --> 00:02:43,500
Shrek challenges Donkey, Puss in Boots and his other fairy tale character friends to spend the night in Lord
Farquaad's haunted castle, telling scary stories to see who can resist becoming scared and stay the longest.

3
00:03:56,250 --> 00:04:02,250
Shrek (voice), played by Mike Myers.

4
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:21,000
Princess Fiona (voice), played by Cameron Diaz.

5
00:06:33,750 --> 00:06:39,750
Puss in Boots (voice), played by Antonio Banderas.

6
00:07:52,500 --> 00:07:58,500
Donkey (voice), played by Dean Edwards.

7
00:09:11,250 --> 00:09:17,250
Gingerbread Man / Muffin Man (voice), played by Conrad Vernon.

8
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:36,000
Sugar (voice), played by Kristen Schaal.

9
00:11:48,750 --> 00:11:54,750
Scared Shrekless is a 2010 American animated Halloween horror
comedy television special based on the Shrek franchise.

10
00:13:07,500 --> 00:13:13,500
The special premiered on the American television
network NBC on October 28, 2010.

11
00:14:26,250 --> 00:14:32,250
The special marks the first time outside of the video games that Donkey is now
voiced by Dean Edwards since Eddie Murphy was unable to return.

12
00:15:45,000 --> 00:15:51,000
Rupert Everett and Chris Miller were both replaced by Sean Bishop as Prince Charming and Mister Geppetto respectively
while Miles Christopher Bakshi and Nina Zoe Bakshi reprise their roles as Fergus, Farkle, and Felicia.

13
00:17:03,750 --> 00:17:09,750
It was produced with the working title of Shrek or Treat.

14
00:18:22,500 --> 00:18:28,500
The film explores themes of halloween, haunted castle, scary stories.

15
00:19:41,250 --> 00:19:47,250
The tone is lighthearted.
